  "reason": "The pinned DATA pattern permits an odd number of hexadecimal digits, although EIP-1474 defines DATA as complete bytes with two hexadecimal digits per byte. Restrict only the reviewed DATA nodes to pairs of lowercase hexadecimal digits. Keep empty DATA and leading zero bytes, and do not change QUANTITY, HexByte, StorageKey, field presence or other constraints. This correction is applied after the existing structural errata; its input digest identifies that effective root.",
