  ],
  "retireWhen": "Review on every source pin or prerequisite erratum change. Remove once the upstream definitions in this target require complete DATA bytes; revise each reviewed path and both digests if upstream changes the schema. Never silently apply this rule to other hex-string families or new source nodes.",
